          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan's domestic League One reverses eligibility curbs after court settlement",
          "body": "South Africa's Bulls thrash Lions 57-15 in URC. Wallabies slip to sixth in world rankings."
        }
      ]
    },
