      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Off-field achievement",
          "heading": "England's Emeka Ilione completes medical degree while playing for Leicester Tigers",
          "body": "England player Emeka Ilione has completed a medical degree while playing for Leicester Tigers, combining club rugby with academic study. The milestone is a club-level story rather than a selection one, so for England followers it is a personal achievement rather than a November talking point, but one that marks Ilione out as a player with more than one plan."
        },
