    },
    "388": {
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "edition": "Sunday 11 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "URC fallout",
          "heading": "Bundee Aki’s latest ‘lippy’ outburst follows Connacht’s 36-19 Scotstoun mauling",
          "body": "In the URC, Glasgow beat Connacht 36-19 at Scotstoun on Friday night, four of their five tries coming from the maul, and Planet Rugby’s round-three review leads with Bundee Aki’s latest ‘lippy’ outburst. Connacht, the Irish province, started the brighter but were reduced to 14 men by Sam Illo’s sin-binning before half-time, and last won away at Glasgow in September 2010."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji part ways with coach Mick Byrne by mutual agreement",
