          "kicker": "Season tally",
          "heading": "Italy go winless through three Nations Championship rounds, sitting 11th of 12",
          "body": "Italy have no wins from three Nations Championship matches. In the log they sit 11th of 12, with no draws and three defeats. Across those three matches their points tally reads 37 for and 131 against, a difference of minus 94. The most recent result was a 10-57 loss to Australia in Round 3, and South Africa are next in Round 4."
