      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "URC team news",
          "heading": "Koroibete set for Ospreys URC debut as Paea starts for Dragons",
          "body": "In the United Rugby Championship (URC), Marika Koroibete makes his Ospreys debut on the wing at Rodney Parade, where the Wallabies star will look to help a side in search of its first win of the season after back-to-back defeats in South Africa. Facing them in the all-Welsh meeting, the Dragons come off a 38-26 win over Scarlets and make three changes to their starting XV, with Fetuli Paea starting at outside centre in his first start of the new season."
        },
        {
