          "kicker": "Eligibility rollback",
          "heading": "Japan Rugby League One reverses eligibility curbs after 24-player court settlement",
          "body": "In August, Japan's domestic Rugby League One has rolled back a planned eligibility change after 24 affected players took the matter to court. Under the proposed rules, Japanese passport holders born abroad and not educated in Japan as children would have been restricted; the settlement treats players who acquired Japanese nationality before the end of May 2025 on a par with native-born players. Timothy Lafaele, who starred for Japan at the 2019 World Cup, was among the plaintiffs. Officials say the Japan-born pool is shrinking."
