          "heading": "Bulls thrash Lions 57-15 as returning Springboks Grobbelaar, Hanekom and Moodie shine",
          "body": "Saturday's United Rugby Championship (URC) fixture, a club match rather than a Test, saw the Bulls beat the Lions 57-15 at Loftus Versfeld with four returning Springboks in the starting XV: Johan Grobbelaar, Gerhard Steenekamp, Cameron Hanekom and Canan Moodie. A yellow card to Lions scrum-half Morne van den Berg helped the hosts go 31-10 up at half-time. Handré Pollard came off the bench to slot three conversions, and the Bulls bounced back from a narrow defeat at Munster."
